    },
    {
      "subId": "42704",
      "subQuestName": "与安柏对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4270401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4270401": {
            "id": "4270401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "看来你已经掌握了用风之翼飞行的诀窍，那么我们就开始最后一环吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4270402"
            ]
          },
          "4270402": {
            "id": "4270402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "毕竟这条路已经飞过一次了呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4270403"
            ]
          },
          "4270403": {
            "id": "4270403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "那么，这是最后一项测试，通过了之后就可以等着飞行执照签发啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4270404"
            ]
          },
          "4270404": {
            "id": "4270404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "朝着飞行执照，预备…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4270405"
            ]
          },
          "4270405": {
            "id": "4270405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…开始！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
